WEBVTT

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.240
Are you the one who's been attacking travelers?

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:20.580
So what if I am?

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:22.120
I will defeat you!

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:23.470
Hmm?

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:26.210
You're going to defeat me?

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:27.750
How interesting.

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:30.340
I'll take you on!

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:35.910
Even if you hide your face, I know who you are.

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:39.160
You have the smell of the Bansu family.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:53.090
Huh? You're not Claudette?

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:54.860
I am Leina!

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:56.450
The noble warrior, Leina!

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:04.250
That's strange... I could have sworn I picked up Claudette's scent.

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:09.540
Oh well. Lightning General Claudette wouldn't be at such a low level.

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:12.920
All I did was tear your clothes a bit, and you went like 'Kya!'

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:15.720
<i>She completely recovered from that attack...</i>

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:17.670
<i>This demon is strong.</i>

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:19.180
What is your goal?

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:24.020
Me? I only want to have fights with strong warriors.

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:27.620
I'm a participant in Queen's Blade.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.150
Queen's Blade?

00:01:30.550 --> 00:01:31.730
It's beginning.

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:36.260
The battle that occurs every four years to determine the new Queen.

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:49.830
Queen's Blade.

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:56.500
This is a ritual of the gods, used to decide the strongest and most beautiful queen.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.740
The one who is worthy to be Queen...

00:01:58.740 --> 00:02:02.180
This is something that won't be determined until they fight.

00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:06.430
Oh no! I'm going to be late!

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:10.410
Well then, I'll have you answer my question.

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:15.150
Why do you, a Queen candidate, have the same smell as Claudette?

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:18.100
Claudette and Leina, huh?

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:21.950
Leina, Leina... Where have I heard that name?

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:23.120
Ah!

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:30.090
The Bansu family's daughter, Leina Bansu.

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:32.040
She's Claudette's little sister?

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:34.840
Things are getting interesting!

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:36.760
I will cut you down here!

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:50.200
Futile!

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:51.810
It's going to gradually melt away!

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:57.450
'Kya!' Hehehe... Yelling 'kya' like that... how cute!

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:59.530
You really are a weakling, aren't you?

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:02.080
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:03.910
<i>At this rate, I'm done for.</i>

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.620
You monster!

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:11.750
Huh?

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:15.380
What did you just say?

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:18.060
You just called me a monster, didn't you?

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:19.460
A monster...

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:22.180
You know, not a single person has lived after calling me that.

00:03:22.650 --> 00:03:24.750
I'm going to kill you.

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:28.060
I'm not the type of woman who cares about things like morals.

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:30.730
Bye bye, Leina.

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:52.210
Just who are you?

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:54.550
I am Risty,

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:55.950
the chivalrous thief of the wilderness.

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:58.070
I'll remember this, Risty.

00:03:58.070 --> 00:04:01.050
I'll deal with that weakling over there later.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:09.970
Late! Late! I'm late!

00:04:12.170 --> 00:04:17.670
I am the Angel of Glory, Nanael, here to introduce the participants of Queen's Blade.

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:21.220
I will explain everything you need to know!

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:24.030
Open the door that leads to the ordeals!

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:25.740
Huh?

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:50.390
That vulgar monster is a subordinate of the Witch of the Swamplands, a demon known as Marona.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:53.510
She's an opponent a young girl like yourself can't handle.

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:54.520
<i>Witch of the Swamplands?</i>

00:04:55.090 --> 00:05:00.270
People who don't know their own strength compared to others are nothing but fools.

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:01.690
Remember that.

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:05.150
That's mine! Give it back!

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:07.340
You've got it wrong.

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:10.250
You are my spoil of war.

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:12.580
In other words, these are mine now.

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:13.750
You thief.

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:18.010
I'm going to say it now, so listen to me carefully, young lady.

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:22.800
The victorious will obtain everything. That is the continental law.

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:25.450
I am the chivalrous thief of the wasteland, Risty.

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:26.960
Remember this well...

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:29.590
Leina, fugitive daughter of count Bansu.

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:30.430
Eh?

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:35.480
We finally made it.

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:41.330
After this, we're off to the castle of the great family, count Bansu.

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:42.570
In order words, your home.

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:44.140
Let me go.

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:46.000
I have no intention of returning there.

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:47.620
Can I ask you something?

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:51.170
Why did they put a 300 gold coin bounty on your head?

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:53.600
I don't know, and I don't want to know.

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:59.390
Well, it isn't normal for parents to put a bounty on their children.

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:00.790
You have my sympathy.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.500
Then let me go!

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:04.270
That's something I can't do.

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:11.650
What an extravagant bridge. Even though the people are starving...

00:06:11.650 --> 00:06:13.810
Truly a good example of misgovernment.

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:17.060
You should tell the count about this.

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:22.400
Well then, how about you give me a nice reward?

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:26.550
I've brought the fugitive wanted by the Bansu family.

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:28.490
She's just a little rattled.

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:33.070
Leina, where did you go?

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:37.210
You usually go to places where I can find you quickly...

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:39.210
Elina doesn't like this at all.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.660
Oh, I see!

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:44.130
Leina doesn't like parties, right?

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:48.840
Elina hates it when Leina has those perverted mens' eyes on her!

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:51.840
Leina is for Elina alone!

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:52.710
What is it?

00:06:53.460 --> 00:06:55.100
Leina-sama has returned.

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:57.060
What? Is that true?

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:01.690
Leina!

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:02.970
Elina!

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:05.770
I'm sorry, Elina couldn't find you anywhere.

00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:07.860
I had no intention of re{fscx200}-

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:11.520
Even so, you're all messed up, Leina.

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:13.270
Just look at you...

00:07:13.270 --> 00:07:15.890
Even though Elina is the only one fit to touch you...

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:18.240
Look at how battered you are!

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:19.790
I am not battered at all!

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:24.580
You know, Elina... Elina did nothing but worry about what might happen to you...

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:27.420
Save it for later, and give me my reward already!

00:07:27.770 --> 00:07:28.510
Silence, monkey.

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:30.360
What was that?

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:31.380
Learn your place in society.

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:40.010
Hurray! It looks like the battle hasn't started yet!

00:07:40.010 --> 00:07:43.530
Since observing the Queen's Blade is a job only an angel can do,

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:46.060
it would be a great shame if I failed.

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:51.560
Umm, over there is the chivalrous thief of the wasteland, Risty.

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:56.950
And the other is... youngest daughter and Chief of Bansu family's Imperial Guard, Elina.

00:07:57.230 --> 00:08:01.240
It's a good thing I arrived before the battle. This is going to be good!

00:08:01.240 --> 00:08:03.500
I don't hand money over to monkeys.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.320
I don't tolerate bad manners.

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:06.870
Get out of here.

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:08.880
Oh? So this is how it's going to be?

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:13.550
How about we make a wager on your life, then? How does 3,000 gold coins sound?

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:15.940
You dare threaten the Bansu family?

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.800
It seems you don't value your life!

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:19.680
Yes! Now!

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:34.740
Elina, pay her.

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:37.410
Do you want to hurt the count's reputation?

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:44.120
Please forgive me, Claudette.

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:47.580
Oh... So this is the Lightning General, Claudette.

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:50.800
That makes things simple.

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:54.890
What is it? Let me go.

00:08:54.890 --> 00:09:00.340
I keep my promises, but you are a wanted thief.

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:01.220
What was that?

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:13.740
What a horrible turn of events...

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:16.110
I could use some improvement.

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:18.560
You don't need to feed her.

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:23.790
Tomorrow, I'll investigate you and what happened to my sister thoroughly.

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:25.930
I'll make sure you regret this.

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:27.360
How about giving me some food?

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:28.500
Silence, monkey!

00:09:32.240 --> 00:09:33.990
This has been fun.

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:40.670
You fool. Consider your position.

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:42.800
You're a future countess, after all.

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:45.180
I have no desire to become the countess.

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:48.400
Isn't my sister more suited for the position?

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:49.060
Besides that...

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:51.420
The future countess has already been decided.

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:54.530
I will decide for myself what I want to be.

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:55.650
Give it up!

00:09:56.860 --> 00:10:01.010
You are going to attend the party tonight.

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:02.370
Make sure to prepare for it properly.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:06.120
I can see you over there, Elina.

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:25.630
Everyone just does what they want...

00:10:25.630 --> 00:10:27.680
No one understands my feelings.

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:29.480
Leina!

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:34.360
Don't be so sulky!

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:41.480
That's right.

00:10:42.230 --> 00:10:44.030
We were both scolded.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:48.960
Found you, Leina.

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.700
You're tired, right?

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:08.850
I'll give you a massage.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:10.640
I'm fine without one.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:16.690
Then let me comb your hair.

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:19.690
You have to do that regularly, right?

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:25.020
Leina, running away won't change anything, you know.

00:11:25.020 --> 00:11:27.680
We'll just bring you back again.

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:29.080
You have a responsibility to your title.

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:34.020
You should get married. Putting your family at ease is the best solution.

00:11:34.020 --> 00:11:36.250
Those are all things I don't wish for.

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:41.630
Of course, I don't want to see all those men flirting with you either.

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:47.870
The man that marries you will be my opponent, and I will make it his biggest regret.

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:50.310
He won't lay one finger on you.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:53.390
That's why I want you to be by Elina's side forever.

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:54.720
Elina...

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:57.470
Ah! Your hair is burned!

00:11:57.470 --> 00:11:58.900
This must be that monkey's doing!

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:00.860
Are you talking about Risty?

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:04.300
You're wrong, that came from a fight with a demon.

00:12:04.300 --> 00:12:07.410
A demon, you say? Eh?

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:11.880
If she hadn't been there, the situation would have been much worse.

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:12.900
I'm sure of it...

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:18.250
You shouldn't worry about things like that, because I'll protect you, Leina.

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:26.420
Ah~, I wanted to sleep with her...

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:29.170
Guards, don't let a single person in.

00:12:33.400 --> 00:12:35.270
I've returned here once again.

00:12:35.970 --> 00:12:38.980
If I had managed to get past those mountains, I would have been free.

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:41.820
I wanted to go....

00:12:45.970 --> 00:12:52.040
Daddy! Leina... Leina wants to be strong, like Mommy!

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:57.080
A dream?

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:01.130
<i>That monster was strong.</i>

00:13:01.570 --> 00:13:04.050
<i>If Risty hadn't come when she did...</i>

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:12.280
<i>People who don't know their own strength compared to others are nothing but fools.</i>

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:13.180
<i>Remember that.</i>

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:17.530
<i>How did Risty defeat Melona?</i>

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:18.940
<i>Where was her weak point?</i>

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:23.140
<i>If she had not interfered at that time...</i>

00:13:23.140 --> 00:13:26.070
<i>No. I can't just avoid this...</i>

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:28.030
<i>Just what should I do?</i>

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:38.040
Well then, how about we start our own party?

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:53.100
What a catch!

00:13:57.040 --> 00:13:57.840
This is...

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:03.440
Ehh?

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:04.860
The thief!

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:08.810
That monkey! To think that she managed to escape...

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:10.710
I'll teach her a lesson!

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:12.530
Inform all the troops!

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:13.030
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:19.290
Eh? This is a bit dangerous!

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.020
It's the thief!

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:22.290
Capture her!

00:14:25.940 --> 00:14:26.720
Risty?

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:27.550
Shh!

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:32.850
Risty, you...

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:35.310
Sh!

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:40.750
Sorry for my intrusion.

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:44.410
Claudette.

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:46.530
What is it?

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:50.120
The thief has escaped, and is somewhere in the castle.

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:53.700
The army will be guarding you instead of Chief Elina.

00:14:54.380 --> 00:14:56.200
That isn't necessary.

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:57.950
There isn't any danger to me here.

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:02.330
I don't need any of the count's troops.

00:15:02.940 --> 00:15:05.460
This is an order from the count himself.

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:07.420
From Father?

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:12.430
Leina, are you alright?

00:15:13.780 --> 00:15:16.590
Claudette, why are you here?

00:15:16.590 --> 00:15:19.450
I've been ordered to fulfill your duty.

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:22.020
We will have this situation taken care of very soon.

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:23.650
I'm returning to my post.

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:25.900
<i>She must have noticed me.</i>

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:28.810
Everything is fine as long as you're safe, Leina.

00:15:28.810 --> 00:15:30.490
Be careful not to wander out of here, okay?

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:33.730
<i>Incredible!</i>

00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:37.050
<i>In that moment, when I felt my sister's blood lust,</i>

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:38.330
<i>I was unable to move.</i>

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:43.170
I'll give this to you.

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:43.750
What is this?

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:46.920
A reward for saving me just now.

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:50.770
You weren't wearing any armor while you were fighting that demon.

00:15:50.770 --> 00:15:53.260
This is... our house's heirloom.

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:55.090
You really are a thief!

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:58.260
You're mistaken. I'm not a thief.

00:15:58.260 --> 00:16:01.020
I'm Risty, the chivalrous thief of the wasteland.

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:04.810
Strengthen your guard. Don't let her escape!

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:30.840
It seems I won't be getting out of here that easily!

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:39.650
Why won't you just let me go?

00:16:39.650 --> 00:16:41.670
Don't fool yourself, thief.

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:42.930
I will crush you.

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:45.260
I'm a chivalrous thief, and yet...

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:46.980
Well, if that's the way you want it, let's settle this!

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:51.130
A thief like you is not even worthy to be my opponent.

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:52.280
I'll show you your place.

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:56.700
We'll see about that! You never know until you try.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:17:00.490
Those who are strong can obtain everything! This is continental law!

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.040
Try this on for size!

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:09.290
The harbor... Shit!

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:16.130
<i>Mother, please give me this longsword and armor.</i>

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:20.100
<i>From this point onwards, I will become strong!</i>

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:32.110
<i>The strong will obtain everything.</i>

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:40.630
Where do you think you're going, Leina?

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:43.410
I wouldn't want you to leave me behind!

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:54.380
You will pay for insulting the count's family. Let's settle this.

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:57.300
Isn't this going too far, Lightning General?

00:18:05.210 --> 00:18:06.650
I told you, didn't I?

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:10.150
Not a single person has called me a monster and lived.

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:15.150
So, as promised, I've come here to kill you.

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:27.070
Leina!

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:29.670
What is this?

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:37.420
You have nowhere left to run. Are you ready to fight yet?

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:39.840
You're not even on your feet.

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:43.890
Look, "No~, it's embarrassing!"

00:18:47.510 --> 00:18:50.120
Ah, you've wet yourself!

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:50.730
Eh?

00:18:52.300 --> 00:18:54.890
Too bad. You can't run anymore.

00:18:58.040 --> 00:19:02.090
Damn. I have no choice but to abandon all my loot...

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:04.200
They're going to be disappointed.

00:19:05.220 --> 00:19:06.170
Prepare yourself!

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:06.790
Oh shi{fscx200}-

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:14.110
Wait, thief!

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:15.210
As if I'd do that!

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:23.180
Elina? No, Leina?

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:25.880
You'll die if you fall, Leina!

00:19:25.880 --> 00:19:27.850
Make this fun for me!

00:19:35.590 --> 00:19:36.960
<i>Just five more steps.</i>

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:37.610
<i>Four steps.</i>

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:41.400
Monster! I will defeat you, and move forward!

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:43.680
You dare call me a monster again?

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:44.780
<i>Three steps.</i>

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:45.570
<i>Two steps.</i>

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:46.780
<i>One step.</i>

00:19:52.410 --> 00:19:53.670
Come, monster!

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:55.120
Unforgivable!

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:56.510
I will completely dissolve you!

00:19:57.240 --> 00:19:57.920
Now!

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:16.890
What? You figured it out?

00:20:17.390 --> 00:20:19.900
You won't know what happens until you fight, right?

00:20:20.470 --> 00:20:21.650
It's painful!

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:24.400
It burns like the sun!

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:31.450
Leina!

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:35.370
Not bad, Leina.

00:20:53.990 --> 00:20:55.810
Yo! You alright?

00:20:56.780 --> 00:20:57.610
Risty...

00:20:58.650 --> 00:20:59.650
Probably.

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:02.730
I see. Thanks to the armor I gave you.

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:04.320
I guess so.

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:07.030
Well then, what do you intend to do?

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:09.490
I intend to continue my journey.

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:12.460
Then this is my reward.

00:21:12.460 --> 00:21:13.370
I'll be taking it.

00:21:13.590 --> 00:21:15.580
Ah. That's my...

00:21:16.020 --> 00:21:19.750
While fighting Claudette I had to abandon almost all my loot.

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:21.300
This much is fine, right?

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:22.940
No way! Wait!

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:23.720
Give that back!

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:24.740
Thief!

00:21:24.740 --> 00:21:26.300
Like I said...

00:21:29.940 --> 00:21:33.250
What? How could this have happened?

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:38.230
Even though I was supposed to begin the first round of Queen's Blade!

00:23:13.210 --> 00:23:14.420
I am Nanael.

00:23:14.420 --> 00:23:17.410
A glorious angel sent from the skies. *Sparkle~!*

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:20.100
Hey! When did I miss everything?

00:23:20.100 --> 00:23:21.500
I was supposed to appear and start the first round,

00:23:21.500 --> 00:23:25.880
and everyone was going to see the great and beautiful form of Nanael-sama,

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:32.700
but no! I thought I would have the first round, but even so.... even so...!

00:23:32.700 --> 00:23:36.140
Everything was ruined! Grr! I'll fix this!

00:23:36.140 --> 00:23:38.050
Next time: Ambitious Undertaking ~ Warrior Shrine Maiden

00:23:38.050 --> 00:23:41.060
This time I'll skillfully explain everything!
